CVE-2025-15367, gh-143923: poplib rejects control characters in a command: a CR
or LF of an argument (user name, message number ...) ended the command and the
rest went to the server as another POP3 command. Upstream: main b234a2b67539
(20.01.2026); no release of 3.12 has it, its backport (python/cpython#162136) is
open on 26.11.2026. The lines of Lib/poplib.py of b234a2b67539 as they are.

